---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro"
import ContactCTA from "../../components/ContactCTA.astro"
import Hero from "../../components/Hero.astro"
---
<BaseLayout title="November Events | Side Quests Colorado" description="November 2026 Events">
	<div class="stack gap-20">
		<main class="wrapper about">
			<Hero
				title="November 2026 Bike Events"
				tagline="Check out the cool events you can go to in November."
			>
				<img
					width="1553"
					height="873"
					src="/assets/november-bikes.png"
					alt="A bike and daisies."
				/>
    </Hero>
	<section>
		<h2 class="section-title">Bikes</h2>
			<div class="content">
				<h3>Nov 3: Election Day</h3>
				<p>Go out and vote! <a href="https://www.sos.state.co.us/pubs/elections/VIP.html" target="_blank">Find your polling place</a></p>
			</div>
			<div class="content">
				<h3>Nov 8: Women's Ride</h3>
				<p><a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/DfNtZMoGmuT/" target="_blank">Pedal Bike Shop</a> is hosting a Women's ride.</p>
				<p>Meet at 2640 W Belleview Ave, Ste 100, Littleton at 10:30 AM on Sunday, Nov 8 and wheels up at 11:00 AM.</p>
				<p>This is a no-drop ride.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="content">
				<h3>Nov 12: Fem's and Thems Ride</h3>
				<p>Meet at the Cheesman Pavilian at 6PM.</p>
				<p>Also taking place on Nov 21 10 AM and 24th 6 PM. <a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/Dd6ma2ysIBX/" target="_blank">Learn more more on their instagram.</a> </p>
			</div>
			<div class="content">
				<h3>Nov 14: Black Girls Do Bike Denver Monthly Ride</h3>
				<p>Location and time TBD. All rides are no-drop rides.</p>
				<p>Join the <a href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/blackgirlsdobikeDENVER" target="_blank">Facebook</a> or <a href="https://www.strava.com/clubs/318834?hl=pt-BR" target="_blank">Strava</a> group to find out more.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="content">
				<h3>Nov 14: Colorado History Rides</h3>
				<p>Spooky Fort Collins from 3:30 PM to 5:30 PM</p>
				<p>Learn more and register on <a href="https://www.coloradohistoryrides.com/events/?utm_source=ig&utm_medium=social&utm_content=link_in_bio&fbclid=PAZXh0bgNhZW0CMTEAcGRvZgJzcnRjBmFwcF9pZA85MzY2MTk3NDMzOTI0NTkAAae78e3uCwDguoTfud_1e-2ZNsxXjgjKYJm0MdTh4ju39qFfSU3uGXaVD6KcMQ_aem_hl7xTLDzfWbnP6HuBfw79g" target="_blank">the History Colorado Website</a></p>
			</div>
			<div class="content">
				<h3>Nov 21: Novemberfest</h3>
				<p>Join <a href="https://www.instagram.com/wash_park_crewzers/" target="_blank">@wash_park_crewzers/</a> for Novemberfest</p>
				<p>Meet at Picnic Site #2 at 6:30 PM. Wheels up at 7:00 PM</p>
				<p>BYOB</p>
			</div>
			<div class="content">
				<h3>Nov 22: Cranksgiving 2026</h3>
				<p>It's bike-powered food drive hosted by <a href="https://www.instagram.com/zcycleshop/" target="_blank">@zcycleshop</a>, <a href="https://www.instagram.com/denverfoodrescue/" target="_blank">@denverfoodrescue</a>, <a href="https://www.instagram.com/bikes.together/" target="_blank">@bikes.together</a>, <a href="https://www.instagram.com/hardt_family_cyclery/" target="_blank">@hardt_family_cyclery</a>, <a href="https://www.instagram.com/abob_denver/" target="_blank">@abob_denver</a> and <a href="https://www.instagram.com/bigdumbrides/" target="_blank"> @bigdumbrides</a></p>
				<p>start from Z Cycle Shop on East Colfax - gathering at 9:00 AM@/ wheels down by 9:30 AM. All are welcome. Bring your friends.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="content">
				<h3>Nov 28: Colorado History Rides</h3>
				<p>Philip K Dick Tribute Ride from 11 AM to 1:00 PM</p>
				<p>Learn more and register on <a href="https://www.coloradohistoryrides.com/events/?utm_source=ig&utm_medium=social&utm_content=link_in_bio&fbclid=PAZXh0bgNhZW0CMTEAcGRvZgJzcnRjBmFwcF9pZA85MzY2MTk3NDMzOTI0NTkAAae78e3uCwDguoTfud_1e-2ZNsxXjgjKYJm0MdTh4ju39qFfSU3uGXaVD6KcMQ_aem_hl7xTLDzfWbnP6HuBfw79g" target="_blank">the History Colorado Website</a></p>
			</div>
	</section>
	<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Disclaimers</h2>
					<div class="content">
						<p>
							Colorado Side Quests does not endorse any of the events, organizations and individuals listed on this page or on our site. The information provided is information only. Attend any event at your own risk. Neither Colorado Side Quests, nor it's contributors are not responsible for your health, safety or wellbeing and will not be held responsible for any real or percieved injuries you face after attending any of the events listed on our site or by using any third-party links on our site. We cannot control you or any third-party individual or organization or their website. Use the Colorado Side Quests website or Instagram at your own risk.
						</p>
					</div>
			</section>
      </main>

		<ContactCTA />
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.about {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3.5rem;
	}

	img {
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 1.5rem;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
	}

	section {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		color: var(--gray-200);
	}

	.section-title {
		grid-column-start: 1;
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		color: var(--gray-0);
	}

	.content {
		grid-column: 2 / 4;
	}

	.content :global(a) {
		text-decoration: 1px solid underline transparent;
		text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
		transition: text-decoration-color var(--theme-transition);
	}

	.content :global(a:hover),
	.content :global(a:focus) {
		text-decoration-color: currentColor;
	}

	@media (min-width: 50em) {
		.about {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 60% 1fr;
		}

		.about > :global(:first-child) {
			grid-column-start: 2;
		}

		section {
			display: contents;
			font-size: var(--text-lg);
		}
	}
</style>